{"campaign":{"class":"known answer (reasoning, data, code)","dates_note":"The dates of execution are declared by NEO AI. The dates attested by third parties are those of the time-stamps: the protocol at 12:24:14Z and 12:24:15Z on 23 November 2026 (FreeTSA, DigiCert), the ledger entry of the campaign at 13:29:26Z (DigiCert), this pack when it was generated and stamped.","declared_finished_at":"2026-11-23T13:29:26.175Z","declared_started_at":"2026-11-23T12:26:11.338Z","interruptions":0,"lab_run_id":"01a2085e-f80a-7484-8825-298e2ec04b18","preregistration":{"detail":"The protocol (systems, 99 tasks, measures, two thresholds, round of the public draw, stop rules) was published in the public proof repository and time-stamped by FreeTSA at 12:24:14Z and by DigiCert at 12:24:15Z on 23 November 2026, before the first answer was requested at 12:26:11Z (time declared by NEO AI). It is in this pack with its time-stamp tokens; it was signed with Sigstore and committed to OpenTimestamps by the public workflow. It was not deposited in an academic registry. This test repeats Official Test No. 3 on the same 99 tasks with the same thresholds, which were known from that test: it is a repetition, not a blind test.","file":"protocol-test-4.md","published":"https://github.com/myneogroup-ai/neolabs-proofs/blob/main/protocols/test-4.md","sha256":"64ab001bd00a8af71ba05c4af88de2d6d19fb43af8df976cfc366d502b6dc5d1","status":"verified","timestamps":[{"authority":"FreeTSA","file":"protocol-test-4.freetsa.tsr","standard":"RFC 3161","time":"2026-11-23T12:24:14Z"},{"authority":"DigiCert","file":"protocol-test-4.digicert.tsr","standard":"RFC 3161","time":"2026-11-23T12:24:15Z"}]},"public_sample":{"chain_hash":"52db9ba70e0cc0f6eaf7803dd07447a1f5477735fd3f661792ba94600c84e971","detail":"The protocol fixed round 34217812 of the drand quicknet beacon (due at 18:00:00Z on 23 November 2026) and a sample of ten tasks before the run. This manifest was sealed before that round existed. The round and the sample it draws are recorded in the publication index once the League of Entropy has published the round.","round":34217812,"round_time":"2026-11-23T18:00:00Z","size":10,"status":"pending"},"seed":"ff3d8ed917441c50","systems":5,"task_set_version":"v6-2026-11-22","tasks":99,"thresholds":{"accuracy_gap_max_points":7,"cost_reduction_min":0.3,"references":["model:model:anthropic/claude/claude-opus-5-5@2026-10-11","model:model:openai/gpt/gpt-5.5@2026-10-11"],"subject":"profile:auto"}},"costs":{"computed":{"scope":"Inference cost of each answer, computed by the platform from the token counts reported by the providers and the price table in force on the day, including the internal calls of a LILI profile","unit":"millionths of a US dollar per answer"},"out_of_scope":["Infrastructure and hosting of the platform"],"reconciled":null,"reconciliation_limit":"Provider invoices and usage reports are issued per organisation and per period, not per campaign: the cost of the answers of this test cannot be attributed from them. The per-answer costs are the platform's computation, not invoices."},"files":[{"bytes":1988,"path":"digicert-trusted-root-g4.pem","role":"DigiCert Trusted Root G4 (public certificate)","sha256":"ce7d6b44f5d510391be98c8d76b18709400a30cd87659bfebe1c6f97ff5181ee"},{"bytes":2833,"path":"freetsa-cacert.pem","role":"FreeTSA root certificate (public)","sha256":"2151b61137ffa86bf664691ba67e7da0b19f98c758e3d228d5d8ebf27e044438"},{"bytes":2273,"path":"freetsa-tsa.crt","role":"FreeTSA time-stamp certificate (public)","sha256":"8bfb0305bb64e2571ca507552ef3245cb1c2fee8728e0ff8689225081ea13467"},{"bytes":3797,"path":"ledger-entry-3669.json","role":"Proof Ledger entry no. 3669 (the seal of the campaign)","sha256":"564a1e0bd8c91fcdaefcb0f15be91b2d11f13c985f6fb1922e8f215822c2299a"},{"bytes":5995,"path":"protocol-test-4.digicert.tsr","role":"RFC 3161 time-stamp token of the protocol (DigiCert)","sha256":"1bed0cfa49dd9921cc8e8d42a44e2452a6874555e0359dd6def01ddc4719bbb7"},{"bytes":46